  info: 'A damselfly is a winged insect in the order Odonata. They are closely related
    to dragonflies but are smaller and slimmer. Like dragonflies, damselflies are
    skilled predators, though their smaller size limits the size of prey they can
    capture.


    Source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Damselfly '
